  "notes": [
    "Play-In: two GSL groups of four, Bo3; the top two of each group play crossed Bo5 qualifiers (A1 vs B2, B1 vs A2) and the winners join the Swiss stage. Swiss: 16 teams, three wins or losses, Bo3 when a match can decide advancement or elimination, otherwise Bo1. Knockout: 8-team single elimination, Bo5.",
    "The EMEA vs NA Worlds Qualifying Series that sent Team BDS to the play-in is treated as a qualifier, not part of the event, as in Leaguepedia's results.",
    "Swiss rematches are allowed: KT Rolster and Dplus KIA met again in round 5 although a rematch-free draw of that pool existed. The exact 2023 draw rule is unverified.",
    "Formats, series lengths and placements are verified by replaying the recorded results.",
    "Not modelled: the Swiss round-1 pools, region protection in draws, and the exact knockout draw. Forward simulations draw these randomly, except that undefeated Swiss teams are kept apart and face 3-2 teams."
  ],
